ict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Salary range and required-skills validation missing\", \"actual\": \"Submitted a job with Minimum Salary 120000 > Maximum Salary 90000 and zero required skills. The form accepted it: redirected to dashboard with \\\"Job posted successfully!\\\" and the job appears as \\\"QA Test Engineer ... Seattle, WA · $120000 - $90000/hr · Posted Yesterday\\\". No error feedback was shown. (Empty-field validation for title/salary/description does work via HTML5 required.)\", \"evidence\": \"Dashboard entry: \\\"Engineering Contract QA Test Engineer Seattle, WA · $120000 - $90000/hr\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No duplicate-email guard per job\", \"actual\": \"After applying to \\\"Automation QA Analyst\\\" as dana.whitfield@example.com, a second application with the identical email (name \\\"Dana W Duplicate\\\") was accepted with the same \\\"Application submitted!\\\" success toast. The dashboard application count for that job rose from 1 to 2 and Total Applications from 4 to 5.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Success toast shown on submit; dashboard \\\"Applications (2)\\\" under Automation QA Analyst contains exactly one record for the submitted application: \\\"Dana Whitfield / dana.whitfield@example.com / 555-0199 / I have five years of automation experience with Playwright and TypeScript.\\\" (second record is the separate duplicate-test submission).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Result list and \\\"Showing N jobs\\\" counter updated immediately on each keystroke/filter change without page reload. No-results state reached via search \\\"zzzznotarealjob\\\" and via combination Technology+Seattle+Full-time, both showing \\\"Showing 0 jobs\\\" + \\\"No jobs found / Try adjusting your filters or search terms\\\". \\\"Clear filters\\\" reset search box and all three selects, restoring all 10 jobs.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No persistence — all state resets to seed data on reload\", \"actual\": \"State is held only in memory (localStorage/sessionStorage are empty). After reloading /employer/dashboard: (1) the published job \\\"QA Test Engineer\\\" disappeared and Active Jobs reverted 6→5; (2) the just-submitted application from Priya Raman for that job was lost, Total Applications reverted to the seed value 3; (3) a confirmed deletion of the seed job \\\"Part-Time Content Writer\\\" was undone — the job reappeared and Active Jobs went back to 5.\", \"evidence\": \"Post-reload dashboard: Active Jobs=5, Total Applications=3, \\\"Part-Time Content Writer\\\" present again despite being deleted.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each card shows industry (Technology), type (Full-time), title (Senior Frontend Developer), company (TechCorp Solutions), location (San Francisco, CA), salary ($140k - $180k), date (Jan 15), skills (React/TypeScript/CSS/Node.js). Consistent across all 8 cards.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/jobs/job-1787886583804 shows Technology, Full-time, Automation QA Analyst, TechCorp Solutions, Austin TX, $90k - $130k, Posted date, full Job Description, and Required Skills (Playwright, TypeScript) — all matching the selected card.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each application renders as a distinct card with applicant name, email, optional phone (555-0199 shown; omitted cleanly for the record submitted without a phone), submission date, and message. Seeded records (Alex Johnson 555-0101 Jan 20; Maria Garcia 555-0102 Jan 22) likewise complete.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Off-by-one relative posting date for newly c